# Environment variables (copy to `.env.local`)

## Site URL (required in production for share links & invites)
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://survei.example.com
```

## MongoDB
```
MONGODB_URI=
```

## Firebase (auth + fallback storage when AWS S3 is not set)
```
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_APP_ID=

# Google One Tap (opsional) — Web client ID dari Firebase/Google Cloud Console
# Dipakai untuk deteksi email Gmail responden di Chrome tanpa halaman login.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL=
FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY=
```

## AWS S3 (optional)
When set, Survei uploads form files & header images to private S3 instead of Firebase Storage.
Same env names as **simk-garum** (`AWS_*`). Legacy `S3_*` aliases still work.

```
AWS_REGION=ap-southeast-3
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
AWS_BUCKET=your-bucket-name

```

Optional:

```
# Custom S3-compatible endpoint (MinIO, etc.) — leave unset for real AWS
# DOCUMENT_STORAGE_ENDPOINT=

# Legacy aliases (optional if AWS_* is set)
# AWS_S3_BUCKET=  AWS_S3_REGION=  S3_*

# Prefix for all object keys (e.g. survei_keuskupan/form-headers/...)
# AWS_S3_PREFIX=
```

Objects are **private** (no public ACL). The app serves files via short-lived signed URLs on read — same pattern as simk-garum. Ensure the IAM user can `s3:PutObject`, `s3:GetObject`, and `s3:DeleteObject` on the bucket.

## Email (optional — collaborator invites)
When set, Survei sends collaborator invite links via [Resend](https://resend.com). Without these, invite URLs are still created and shown in the UI (and logged on the server).

```
RESEND_API_KEY=
EMAIL_FROM=Survei <noreply@yourdomain.com>
```

## Rate limiting (recommended in production)
When set, public submit/upload limits are enforced across all app instances via [Upstash Redis](https://upstash.com). Without these, limits are in-memory per server process (fine for local dev).

```
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
```

Create a free Upstash Redis database and copy the REST URL + token from the console.
